experimental: simplify reconciliation to core algorithm (#245)

## Summary

Strip optimization machinery (007-optimizations.md) from the
reconciliation hot path, leaving only the core algorithm from
005-reconciliation.md. The designs explicitly separate optimizations as
future work — this change enforces that boundary in the code.

- Replace the complex coordinator/worker DAG walk with a simple
sequential loop over topological order
- Remove 3-layer field-path-scoped hash system, trigger-scoped walks,
per-node resync timers, worker goroutines, forEach incremental diffing,
and evaluation caching
- Preserve correctness: `applySSA`'s content-addressed hash still
prevents unnecessary API writes

